{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45389","headline":"赋得吴王送女潮歌送李判官之河中府 · 皎然","name":"赋得吴王送女潮歌送李判官之河中府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说吴王送女时，行宫直到荆溪口。\n溪上千年送女潮，爲感吴王至今有。\n乃知昔人繇志诚，流水无情翻有情。\n平波忽起二三尺，此上疑与神仙宅。\n今人犹望荆之湄，长令望者增所思。\n吴王已殁女不返，潮水无情那有期。\n溪草何草号帝女，溪竹何竹号湘妃。\n灵涛旦暮自堪伤，的烁婵娟又争发。\n客归千里自兹始，览古高歌感行子。\n不知别後相见期，君意何如此潮水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}